 \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[9.5px] px-1 py-0.2 bg-primary/15 text-primary border border-primary/30 rounded-[2px]\"\u003eV2.3\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-[16px] font-bold text-white font-sans truncate\"\u003e时序残差聚类算法 V2.3\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-metric-return mt-1 flex items-center gap-1\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eKernel: TRC-v2.3-Industrial (已校准)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Card 3: 遥测数据完整度 --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scada-card p-3 flex flex-col justify-between\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-outline text-[10.5px] font-mono mb-1.5\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px] text-real\"\u003enetwork_check\u003c/span\u003e\n            数据完整率 (Data Quality)\n          \u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-real font-bold font-mono text-[10px]\"\u003e无丢包 (Loss: 0%)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[28px] font-mono font-bold text-real leading-none\"\u003e99.8\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-outline\"\u003e%\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- 工业进度标尺 --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"w-full bg-[#1A1D24] h-1.5 rounded-[1px] mt-1.5 overflow-hidden border border-[#2B2E36]\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"bg-real h-full rounded-[1px]\" style=\"width: 99.8%;\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Card 4: 水力平衡健康度 --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"scada-card p-3 flex flex-col justify-between border-urgent/40\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-outline text-[10.5px] font-mono mb-1.5\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-urgent\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\"\u003ecri