x] bg-[#14161B] hover:bg-surface-card-hover text-outline hover:text-primary border border-border-grid transition-colors\" title=\"查看特征指纹\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]\"\u003efingerprint\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-[4px] bg-[#14161B] hover:bg-surface-card-hover text-gray-200 hover:text-primary border border-border-grid text-[10.5px] font-mono flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[13px]\"\u003eplay_circle\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e回放\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- 残差指标与循环泵扰动归因 --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"mt-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-border-grid/70 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono text-on-surface-variant gap-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-warning font-bold\"\u003e[特征残差]\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003ePressure_Surge: +0.08 MPa | 水锤预兆指数: 0.31 | 疑似受上游 2号循环泵启停扰动\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ca class=\"text-primary hover:underline flex items-center gap-0.5 font-bold\" href=\"#\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e调用循环泵振动图谱\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]\"\u003earrow_forward\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- 底部调度与工单快捷栏 --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between pt-2 border-t border-border-grid text-[10.5px] font-mono text-outline gap-2.5\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003e共检出 2 个时序残差异常事件\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-border-grid\"\u003e|\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-gray-400\"\u003e下次自动巡检调度: 2026-11-03 09:00:00 (15 分钟后)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-[4px] bg-[#14161B] hover:bg-surface-card-hover text-gray-200 border border-border-grid transition-colors\"\u003e\n            导出异常时序 CSV\n          \u003c/button\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-[4px] bg-[#14161B] hover:bg-surface-card-hover text-primary border border-primary/40 font-bold transition-colors\"\u003e\n            转交调度闭环工单 (Dispatch)\n          \u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/section\u003e\n\u003c/main\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- 交互脚本 --\u003e\n\u003cscript\u003e\n  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () =\u003e {\n    // 实时 SCADA 工业时钟\n    const clockEl = document.getElementById('clock');\n    const updateClock = () =\u003e {\n      const d = new Date();\n      const pad = n =\u003e String(n).padStart(2, '0');\n      if (clockEl) {\n        clockEl.textContent = `${d.getFullYear()}-${pad(d.getMonth()+1)}-${pad(d.getDate())} ${pad(d.getHours())}:${pad(d.getMinutes())}:${pad(d.getSeconds())}`;\n      }\n    };\n    setInterval(updateClock, 1000);\n    updateClock();\n\n    // 复选框联动交互\n    const selectAllCheckbox = document.getElementById('selectAllCheckbox');\n    const itemCheckboxes = document.querySelectorAll('.item-checkbox');\n    const sendBtn = document.getElementById('sendToAiBtn');\n\n    if (selectAllCheckbox && itemCheckboxes.length \u003e 0) {\n      selectAllCheckbox.addEventListener('change', (e) =\u003e {\n        itemCheckboxes.forEach(cb =\u003e cb.checked = e.target.checked);\n        updateSelectedCount();\n      });\n\n      itemCheckboxes.forEach(cb =\u003e {\n        cb.addEventListener('change', updateSelectedCount);\n      });\n    }\n\n    function updateSelectedCount() {\n      const checkedCount = document.querySelectorAll('.item-checkbox:checked').length;\n      selectAllCheckbox.checked = (checkedCount === itemCheckboxes.length);\n      selectAllCheckbox.parentElement.querySelector('span').textContent = `已选 (${checkedCount}/${itemCheckboxes.length})`;\n      sendBtn.querySelector('span:last-child').textContent = `将选中异常 (${checkedCount}项) 送入自研小模型进行 AI 深入分析`;\n    }\n\n    // AI 发送反馈演示\n    sendBtn.addEventListener('click', () =\u003e {\n      const checkedCount = document.querySelectorAll('.item-checkbox:checked').length;\n      if (checkedCount === 0) {\n        alert('请先在下方勾选待研判的异常事件项！');\n        return;\n      }\n      sendBtn.classList.add('brightness-125');\n      setTimeout(() =\u003e sendBtn.classList.remove('brightness-125'), 200);\n      alert(`已成功将选中的 ${checkedCount} 项异常事件投喂至自研小模型 (ThermalNet-Mini v2.3)，正在生成 SHAP 机理归因报告！`);\n    });\n  });\n\u003c/script\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e"
}
